[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 300.79, "timestamp": "00:05:00", "text": "片頭動畫之類的東西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 306.39, "timestamp": "00:05:06", "text": "對吧？  就是這個東西，對吧？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 309.67, "timestamp": "00:05:09", "text": "Mel的問題在於，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 320.07, "timestamp": "00:05:20", "text": "如果你沒有專注於某個場景，你就無法關閉該媒體檔案"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 322.39, "timestamp": "00:05:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 324.31, "timestamp": "00:05:24", "text": "呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 329.029, "timestamp": "00:05:29", "text": "啊，真是太糟糕了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 332.79, "timestamp": "00:05:32", "text": "而且我的電腦運作緩慢，我覺得是因為這個原因，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 335.35, "timestamp": "00:05:35", "text": "但我也不確定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 338.31, "timestamp": "00:05:38", "text": "兄弟，我竟然收集到了我們生命中的3萬枚硬幣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 340.469, "timestamp": "00:05:40", "text": "。我該買哪個英雄？由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 344.15, "timestamp": "00:05:44", "text": "你決定。喜歡誰就去追吧。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 346.87, "timestamp": "00:05:46", "text": "會說是新角色，他是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 352.15, "timestamp": "00:05:52", "text": "個治療者。呃，她只是收集"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 355.11, "timestamp": "00:05:55", "text": "世界各地的物品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 359.43, "timestamp": "00:05:59", "text": "。  世界物品。呃，就是那個盒子狀的東西。"}]